OL,3,GNEWSAPlan lodged for two council-run
OL,4,Achildren's homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for two new council-run
OL,7,Fchildren's homes in Leicester have been
OL,8,Fsubmitted, with the aim of creating
OL,9,Fseven additional residential care
OL,10,Fplaces for young people with complex
OL,11,Fneeds.
OL,13,FThe scheme would increase the city's
OL,14,Ftotal number of children's home places
OL,15,Fto 47 and aims to reduce Leicester City
OL,16,FCouncil's "reliance on costly
OL,17,Fout-of-area placements".
OL,19,FOne home would be created by converting
OL,20,Fa council-owned property in Evington,
OL,21,Fwhile a second would be built on land
OL,22,Fin Enderby.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
